@McpServer_HostAddress = http://localhost:5123

### Gemini function calling
POST {{McpServer_HostAddress}}/api/Chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Show me the 3 cheapest products",
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Ollama JSON mode
POST {{McpServer_HostAddress}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userQuery": "Show me the 3 cheapest products",
  "userName": "Test User",
  "userId": "1"
}

